<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00218/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个回形针，任何夹在里面的纸最终都会显现出0.3厘米的厚度，该项目理论上可以夹带无数张纸。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.阙的办公桌上。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Dr.李的办公桌上。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Dr.李跟我说这是个Keter级的收容物，而且我当时居然还信了！——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00218" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00218" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00218-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6406351&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609876381" alt="jdque" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6406351)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;">jdque</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590409653 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 May 2020 12:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00212/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块黑板，无法使用任何书写工具在项目上留下任何痕迹（比如使用粉笔时，粉笔灰会直接落下，而不是附着在黑板上）<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市███初级中学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的低价值物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你们感受过在黑板上花了一整支粉笔都写不出一个字，然后底下的学生一直在哄笑的感觉吗？</em>——潜伏在███中学的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00212" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00212" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00212-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609876381" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589937568 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 01:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台███牌的电冰箱，在打开时会将周围的室温升高至5█℃。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>201█/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>申请开设桑拿房。</em>-刚刚检查仓库回来的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>原因？</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
<em>这不仅关系到异常物品的保存，而且关系到我们站点的电费——您能够想象一打开仓库有半个仓库的研究员在用这玩意撒上水蒸桑拿吗？</em>-被一堆研究员拿着记忆删除喷雾追了半个站点的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>拒······批准。</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
-</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00113" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00113-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609876381" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587818740 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 12:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一盘石磨，材质为石膏，上面雕刻有一个投币口和一句话“收件人：阴间礼部张书吏”，投进去一角钱，就会自动转三分钟。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省石料厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的休息室中，允许员工投币自磨豆浆。投进去的硬币将作为捐赠款。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“有钱能使鬼推磨。”这话一点也不假，哼，这玩意儿一定是鬼造的</em>——Dr.shadeoi<br />
<em>我们喝豆浆都喝吐了，所以我们不会再投币了，不会！</em>——特工EVIL</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00068" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00068-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609876381" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587022723 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Apr 2020 07:38</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
